<title>INDIA: India April vehicle production falls.</title>
<headline>India April vehicle production falls.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian production of vehicles fell in April 1997 compared to the same month in the previous year, the Association of Indian Automobile Manufacturers (AIAM) said in a monthly statement on Tuesday.  </p>
<p> AUTOMOBILE PRODUCTION &amp; SALES    (number of units)</p>
<p>  Category			PRODUCTION</p>
<p>			    Apr 97	   Apr 96</p>
<p>   TRUCKS		 20,157	   21,546</p>
<p>   CARS		   23,157	   23,339</p>
<p>   2-WHEELERS	  217,341	  235,040</p>
<p>					SALES</p>
<p>			   Apr 97	    Apr 96</p>
<p>   TRUCKS		14,245	    19,193</p>
<p>   CARS		  22,093	    22,445</p>
<p>   2-WHEELERS	 199,367	   212,157</p>
<p>Source: Association of Indian Automobile Manufacturers</p>
<p>-- New Delhi Newsroom +91-11-301-2024</p>
